---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Hanh Tran – Applied AI Engineer"
  description="Hanh Tran, Applied AI Engineer and founder of Tihado. Agentic AI products from hackathon prototype to hospital production."
  current="work"
  footer="cta"
>
<main style="max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px; box-sizing: border-box">

<section style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 40px 56px; padding: 40px 0 56px">
<div style="flex: 999 1 420px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px">
<p style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">Applied AI Engineer · Founder · Paris</p>
<h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 4.6vw, 3.6rem); line-height: 1.06; letter-spacing: -0.035em; font-weight: 600; text-wrap: balance">I ship agentic AI products, <span style="color: var(--accent)">from hackathon prototype to hospital production.</span></h1>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--body); max-width: 30em; text-wrap: pretty">Founder of Tihado and NLP Research Engineer at Arkhn. I build agents, MCP tools and AI coding workflows, and I teach others to do the same.</p>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 12px">
<a href="#work" style="text-decoration: none; background: var(--ink); color: var(--on-ink); font-weight: 500; font-size: 16px; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 20px">See selected work</a>
<a href="mailto:h@tihado.com" style="text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; font-size: 16px; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 6px; padding: 11px 20px">h@tihado.com</a>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 24px; font-size: 16px">
<a href="https://github.com/honghanhh" style="color: var(--muted); padding: 10px 0">GitHub ↗</a>
<a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=OGb4sloAAAAJ" style="color: var(--muted); padding: 10px 0">Google Scholar ↗</a>
<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/hanh-thi-hong-tran-0b886212a/" style="color: var(--muted); padding: 10px 0">LinkedIn ↗</a>
<a href="https://tihado.com" style="color: var(--muted); padding: 10px 0">tihado.com ↗</a>
</div>
</div>
<div style="flex: 1 1 280px; max-width: 340px; min-width: 0">
<img src="/images/hanh-portrait.jpg" width="460" height="575" alt="Hanh Tran at a harbour, smiling, wearing glasses and a bucket hat" style="display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 8px">
</div>
</section>

<section aria-label="Key numbers" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(190px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 28px 32px; padding: 32px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<div style="font-size: 40px; line-height: 1; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.03em">5 awards</div>
<div style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--muted)">at AI hackathons in 8 months, 3 first places</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<div style="font-size: 40px; line-height: 1; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.03em">1,200+</div>
<div style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--muted)">students taught across 10 VietAI cohorts</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<div style="font-size: 40px; line-height: 1; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.03em">20+ papers</div>
<div style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--muted)">peer-reviewed, with a Best Paper Award</div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="work" style="padding: 56px 0 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 4px 24px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.025em">Selected work</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted)">Built at Tihado with a team of four, idea to demo in days</p>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; border-top: 1px solid var(--ink)">

<article style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 24px; padding: 20px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">
<div style="flex: 0 0 110px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--accent); padding-top: 6px">1st place</div>
<div style="flex: 999 1 320px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px">
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em"><a href="https://tihado.com/blogs/pozify-build-small-backyard-ai-track-win/" style="text-decoration: none">Pozify ↗</a></h3>
<p style="margin: 0; color: var(--body); text-wrap: pretty">Rep-level workout form review from short videos, run by a 182K-parameter model. $4,000 prize.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: var(--muted)">Backyard AI track · Gradio Build Small Hackathon (946 apps)</p>
</div>
<div style="flex: 0 0 auto; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); padding-top: 6px">Jul 2026</div>
</article>

<article style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 24px; padding: 20px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">
<div style="flex: 0 0 110px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--accent); padding-top: 6px">1st place</div>
<div style="flex: 999 1 320px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px">
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em"><a href="https://tihado.com/projects/posey/" style="text-decoration: none">Posey ↗</a></h3>
<p style="margin: 0; color: var(--body); text-wrap: pretty">iOS coach with real-time pose tracking at 30 fps and Gemini Live voice feedback under 200 ms.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: var(--muted)">Startup Track · WELTARE Spring Sprint 1.1.4</p>
</div>
<div style="flex: 0 0 auto; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); padding-top: 6px">Apr 2026</div>
</article>

<article style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 24px; padding: 20px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">
<div style="flex: 0 0 110px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--accent); padding-top: 6px">1st place</div>
