<h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em"><a href="https://tihado.com/projects/lumen/" style="text-decoration: none">Lumen ↗</a></h3>
<p style="margin: 0; color: var(--body); text-wrap: pretty">Voice-first lesson authoring for teachers, orchestrating OpenAI, SLNG, Tavily and fal APIs.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: var(--muted)">SLNG award · &#123;Tech: Europe&#125; Paris AI Hackathon</p>
</div>
<div style="flex: 0 0 auto; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); padding-top: 6px">May 2026</div>
</article>

<article style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 24px; padding: 20px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">
